abstract: >
  Raw benchmark data (10 repeated runs per system), relationship inventories,
  and benchmark harness code for a PhD thesis proposing a design-time
  statistical decision rule (a two-tailed one-sample t-test over repeated
  per-relationship cold/warm cache access measurements) for determining which
  Eloquent/ORM relationships are worth caching before a caching layer is
  implemented. Validated across three independently operated Laravel/Eloquent
  systems: iTeams, Khairat Kematian, and the Vehicle Booking System (VBS).
